From 70ca5aa1605489b00aed6201aca18e278c479277 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: itar3 <62651854+itar3@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 14:59:00 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] Dynamic blend constants and stencil reference

Adds RenderCommandList::setBlendConstants and setStencilReference, and
RenderGraphicsPipelineDesc::dynamicBlendConstantsEnabled and
dynamicStencilReferenceEnabled (both off by default, so existing pipelines
behave as before).

Vulkan: the flags enable VK_DYNAMIC_STATE_BLEND_CONSTANTS and
VK_DYNAMIC_STATE_STENCIL_REFERENCE. D3D12: OMSetBlendFactor and
OMSetStencilRef; binding a pipeline with a dynamic stencil reference no
longer overwrites it. Metal: setBlendColor and setStencilReferenceValue
through the dirty state.

Without them, a renderer whose stencil reference or blend constant changes
per draw needs a pipeline per value.
---
